You will receive £{{ "%.2f" | format(p.rate_per_hour) }} per hour, paid {{ p.payment_method }}{% if p.course_credit %} or course credit{% endif %}{% for c in d.compensation %}{% if loop.first %} ({% endif %}{{ c.procedure }}: {{ c.amount }}{% if not loop.last %}; {% else %}){% endif %}{% endfor %}.{% if p.in_kind %} You will also receive {{ p.in_kind }}.{% endif %}{% if p.prize %} {{ p.prize | capitalize }}.{% endif %}{% if p.travel_expenses %} Reasonable travel expenses are reimbursed.{% endif %} {% if p.pay_on_withdrawal == "full" %}You will be paid in full even if you stop early.{% else %}If you stop early, you will be paid for the time you took part.{% endif %}

